#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:9
#: 84b7980fb79c49bf8c7d28cc5c641b66
msgid ""
"All servo outputs may be mapped to any function supported by ArduPilot. The "
"default settings are for the first 4 channels to be Aileron, Elevator, "
"Throttle and Rudder (commonly known as AETR), but you can re-assign them as "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"所有舵机输出都可以映射到 ArduPilot 支持的任何功能。默认设置是前 4 个通道分别为副翼、升降舵、油门和方向舵（通常称为 "
"AETR），但你可以根据需要重新分配它们。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:14
#: b146dcedb3ee49ae952b8055aa9fac26
msgid ""
"This page describes how to configure these output channels and what each of "
"the available functions is."
msgstr "本页描述了如何配置这些输出通道以及每种可用功能的含义。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:18
#: 58ad5376225a4eb6b0d023bd257ac5a9
msgid "The SERVOn_FUNCTION parameters"
msgstr "SERVOn_FUNCTION 参数"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:20
#: 686ca5d157904aa986b867be806e33c6
msgid ""
"In the advanced parameter view of your GCS you will find that each SERVO "
"output channel has a SERVOn_FUNCTION parameter. For example, "
":ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>` controls the output function of "
"channel 5, :ref:`SERVO6_FUNCTION<SERVO6_FUNCTION>` controls the output "
"function of channel 6 and so on."
msgstr ""
"在地面站的高级参数视图中，你会发现每个 SERVO 输出通道都有一个 SERVOn_FUNCTION "
"参数。例如，:ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>` 控制通道 5 "
"的输出功能，:ref:`SERVO6_FUNCTION<SERVO6_FUNCTION>` 控制通道 6 的输出功能，依此类推。"

