#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:88
#: 81b9a4d3dcc548ee9d5d80eac1329925
msgid ""
"The default values for the first 4 channels are Aileron, Elevator, Throttle "
"and Rudder. The default for all other channels s is 0, meaning disabled. A "
"disabled channel will output the trim value for that channel (for example, "
"if :ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>` is 0 then channel 5 will output "
"SERVO5_TRIM) unless it is overridden by a mission command."
msgstr ""
"前 4 个通道的默认值分别是副翼、升降舵、油门和方向舵。所有其他通道的默认值为 0，即禁用。禁用的通道将输出该通道的微调值（例如，如果 "
":ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>` 为 0，则通道 5 将输出 "
"SERVO5_TRIM），除非被任务命令覆盖。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:94
#: 58e04a12d18746f9b4d6363b50ad1b18
msgid ""
"All of these functions may be used on multiple channels. So if you want 3 "
"elevator channels for some reason you can set SERVOn_FUNCTION to 19 on 3 of "
"your output channels."
msgstr ""
"所有这些功能都可以在多个通道上使用。所以如果你出于某种原因需要 3 个升降舵通道，可以在 3 个输出通道上将 SERVOn_FUNCTION 设为 "
"19。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:99
#: 3a2ad9a7ac744a528424e92d45f93067
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "已禁用"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:101
#: 1a8006d3c707454a9e9bccad1fb51fd6
msgid ""
"For normal operation, the Disabled output function sets the output value of "
"the channel to the trim value. The exception to this is when a MAVLink "
"override of the channel or a mission servo set is used. So in some ways "
"\"disabled\" could be called \"mission-controlled\"."
msgstr ""
"在正常操作中，「已禁用」输出功能将通道的输出值设置为微调值。例外情况是使用 MAVLink "
"通道覆盖或任务舵机设置时。因此在某种意义上，「禁用」可以称为「任务控制」。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:106
#: 11324bccd9fc48a8a6bfac5315553561
msgid ""
"When you fly an auto mission you can ask for a servo to be set to a value as"
" part of that mission. In that case you should set the SERVOn_FUNCTION for "
"that channel to Disabled, so that the value doesn't get changed by another "
"output function immediately after the mission sets the value."
msgstr ""
"当你执行自动任务时，可以在任务中要求将舵机设置为某个值。在这种情况下，你应该将该通道的 SERVOn_FUNCTION "
"设置为「已禁用」，这样在任务设置值之后，该值不会立即被其他输出功能更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:113
#: ea23599d024d45f1b9d4e9afa140d1bc
msgid "RCPassThru"
msgstr "RCPassThru"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:115
#: 772bac75802f402398de9eaf43001753
msgid ""
"Setting a channel to RCPassThru means it will output the value that is "
"coming into the board from the corresponding input channel. For example, if "
":ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>` is 1 (meaning RCPassThru) then "
"channel 5 output will always be equal to channel 5 input."
msgstr ""
"将通道设为 RCPassThru 意味着它将输出来自对应输入通道的值。例如，若 "
":ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>` 为1（即 RCPassThru），则通道5的输出将始终等于通道5的输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:120
#: 18c3b1c432a243db8181eb9de33d621c
msgid ""
"You can also map individual channels to any output channel by using the "
"specific channel mapping functions. These are numbered starting at value 51,"
" for RCInputChannel1. So you can for example set SERVO11_FUNCTION=53 which "
"will map RC input channel 3 to output channel 11."
msgstr ""
"你还可以使用特定的通道映射功能将各个通道映射到任何输出通道。这些功能从值 51 开始编号，对应 RCInputChannel1。例如，你可以设置 "
"SERVO11_FUNCTION=53，将 RC 输入通道 3 映射到输出通道 11。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:125
#: f706749551ca400b9750edb1bd6b14ef
msgid "Flap"
msgstr "襟翼"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:127
#: 80b4f24469904d9e868afc4269717610
msgid ""
"When a channel is set as a flap its value comes from the flap input channel "
"(controlled by the ``RCn_OPTION`` = 208 parameter). The reason you may want "
"to use this instead of a RCPassThru is that you can setup multiple flap "
"channels with different trims and ranges, and you may want to take advantage"
" of the :ref:`FLAP_SLEWRATE<FLAP_SLEWRATE>` to limit the speed of flap "
"movement."
msgstr ""
"当一个通道被设置为襟翼时，其值来自襟翼输入通道（由 ``RCn_OPTION`` = 208 参数控制）。你可能希望使用此功能而不是 "
"RCPassThru 的原因是，你可以设置具有不同微调和范围的多个襟翼通道，并且可能希望利用 "
":ref:`FLAP_SLEWRATE<FLAP_SLEWRATE>` 来限制襟翼运动速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:137
#: 7a0ed41e7fb04f499565709009fdacd5
msgid "Flap_auto"
msgstr "Flap_auto"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:139
#: 27c90dae9e604c5c9f8c17281ac119c5
msgid ""
"The flap auto output function behaves like the Flap output, except it can "
"also accept automatic flap output from the "
":ref:`TKOFF_FLAP_PCNT<TKOFF_FLAP_PCNT>` and "
":ref:`LAND_FLAP_PERCNT<LAND_FLAP_PERCNT>` parameters, as well as the "
"FLAP_1\\_SPEED, FLAP_1\\_PERCNT, FLAP_2\\_SPEED and FLAP_2\\_PERCNT "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"自动襟翼输出功能与「襟翼」输出类似，但它还可以接受来自 :ref:`TKOFF_FLAP_PCNT<TKOFF_FLAP_PCNT>` 和 "
":ref:`LAND_FLAP_PERCNT<LAND_FLAP_PERCNT>` 参数的自动襟翼输出，以及 "
"FLAP_1\\_SPEED、FLAP_1\\_PERCNT、FLAP_2\\_SPEED 和 FLAP_2\\_PERCNT 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:144
#: eea1acef397e46fdbebaf99be036a303
msgid ""
"If you have both a FLAP RC input channel set and a Flap_auto output function"
" set then the amount of flap applied is the higher of the two."
msgstr "如果你同时设置了 FLAP RC 输入通道和 Flap_auto 输出功能，则应用的襟翼量取两者中较大的一个。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:148
#: fc76a883978148ae9fab5b33b6d68085
msgid "Aileron"
msgstr "副翼"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:150
#: a4af9eb4eed440d8b559372175dbb60f
msgid ""
"The aileron output function adds additional aileron outputs, with separate "
"per-channel trim and range. This is useful when you want to trim each "
"aileron separately, or if your main aileron is setup as an elevon mixer "
"(using the ``SERVOn_FUNCTION`` ), and you also want some normal ailerons."
msgstr ""
"副翼输出功能可添加额外的副翼输出，每个通道具有独立的微调和范围。当你想要分别微调每个副翼时，或者当你的主副翼设置为升降副翼混合（使用 "
"``SERVOn_FUNCTION``）且还想要一些普通副翼时，这非常有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:157
#: 49a1a3e6fa0f4f349340b019ceea1449
msgid "Mount_pan, Mount_tilt and Mount_roll"
msgstr "Mount_pan、Mount_tilt 和 Mount_roll"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:159
#: 178f9222574c4024a2389a2e6a1d3949
msgid ""
"These control the output channels for controlling a servo gimbal. Please see"
" the :ref:`camera gimbal configuration documentation <common-camera-gimbal>`"
" for details."
msgstr "这些输出控制舵机云台的输出通道。详情请参阅 :ref:`相机云台配置文档 <common-camera-gimbal>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:162
#: 26c1c739ee474f358b43a7362ecd8030
msgid ""
"The Mount2_pan, Mount2_tilt and Mount2_roll options are the same, but "
"control a second camera gimbal"
msgstr "Mount2_pan、Mount2_tilt 和 Mount2_roll 选项与上述相同，但控制第二个相机云台"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:166
#: 34bfa917c535489180ad160ad3b365b2
msgid "Camera_trigger"
msgstr "Camera_trigger"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:168
#: d26e0ce88d1f48e99203db10e0838d96
msgid ""
"The Camera_trigger output function is used to trigger a camera with a servo."
" See the :ref:`camera gimbal documentation <common-camera-gimbal>` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"Camera_trigger 输出功能用于通过舵机触发相机快门。详情请参阅 :ref:`相机云台文档 <common-camera-gimbal>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:172
#: e580f3ea2d974038a43c599e0ed5d80d
msgid "Elevator"
msgstr "升降舵"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:174
#: 49b3a061ce4f40b8a1868f02b9cdb355
msgid ""
"The elevator output function adds additional elevator outputs, with separate"
" per-channel trim and range. This is useful when you want to trim each "
"elevator separately, or if your main elevator is setup as an elevon mixer "
"(using the ``SERVOn_FUNCTION`` ), and you also want some normal elevator."
msgstr ""
"升降舵输出功能可添加额外的升降舵输出，每个通道具有独立的微调和范围。当你想要分别微调每个升降舵时，或者当你的主升降舵设置为升降副翼混合（使用 "
"``SERVOn_FUNCTION``）且还想要一些普通升降舵时，这非常有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:181
#: 2f5771b5777148809bcaf41515f3afc0
msgid "Rudder"
msgstr "方向舵"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:183
#: 73ebb15c7850472cb65ad2fba1144fe6
msgid ""
"The rudder output function adds additional rudder outputs, with separate "
"per-channel trim and range. Separate rudder channels is particularly useful "
"for nose wheel steering where the nose wheel may need to be reversed as "
"compared to the normal rudder channel or for multi-wheel planes."
msgstr ""
"方向舵输出功能可添加额外的方向舵输出，每个通道具有独立的微调和范围。独立的方向舵通道对于前轮转向特别有用，因为前轮相对于普通方向舵通道可能需要反向，或者用于多轮飞机。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:190
#: 23c463e215304684acb2f557f53e415e
msgid "GroundSteering"
msgstr "GroundSteering"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:192
#: 34f4586ef41d4bf89af954a7bfdfc5e8
msgid ""
"The GroundSteering output function acts much like the rudder output function"
" except that it only acts when the aircraft is below "
":ref:`GROUND_STEER_ALT<GROUND_STEER_ALT>` altitude. At altitudes above "
":ref:`GROUND_STEER_ALT<GROUND_STEER_ALT>` the output will be the trim value "
"for the channel."
msgstr ""
"GroundSteering 输出功能与方向舵输出功能非常类似，区别在于它仅在飞机低于 "
":ref:`GROUND_STEER_ALT<GROUND_STEER_ALT>` 高度时起作用。在高于 "
":ref:`GROUND_STEER_ALT<GROUND_STEER_ALT>` 的高度时，输出将是该通道的微调值。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:200
#: de45ce6842694cbf99f2257f8b58b655
msgid "Flaperons"
msgstr "Flaperons（副翼襟翼）"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:202
#: 9f7dd1137fd54d7ca1d6188fc7d3b61b
msgid ""
"Using SERVOn_FUNCTION 24 and 25 (Flaperon Left / FlaperonRight) you can "
"setup flaperons, which are ailerons that double as flaps. They are very "
"useful for aircraft which have ailerons but no flaps."
msgstr ""
"使用 SERVOn_FUNCTION 24 和 25（左副翼襟翼/右副翼襟翼），你可以设置副翼襟翼，即兼作襟翼的副翼。对于有副翼但无襟翼的飞机非常有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:206
#: 3d00a6155614467394b38d2c14179578
msgid "See the :ref:`flaperon guide <flaperons-on-plane>` for more details."
msgstr "详细信息请参阅 :ref:`副翼襟翼指南 <flaperons-on-plane>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/channel-output-functions.rst:208
#: 9b882a4efe804a3c98b348f71c4a0a23
msgid ""
"Note that flaperons act like Flap_auto described above for the flap "
"component of the output."
msgstr "请注意，对于输出的襟翼部分，副翼襟翼的作用与上述 Flap_auto 相同。"
